{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_05_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_05","title":"主在圣殿中","storyCode":"HE-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9b3c0e0fe600aa44808840658d551548321b2810fb9daedacc3bb449dab78f67","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怀疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是这个意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们呢？你们也和他一样怀疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"别说得那么难听，莱蒙德，什么怀疑不怀疑的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没在这放什么火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"那你怎么会这个点在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你们平常根本不和我们一起祈祷，更不会到圣堂来，你们、你们根本没有信仰......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是没什么信仰，但这和放火是两回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随便你们信不信，我只是......有点私事，碰巧路过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"什么私事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无可奉告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，怎么，我们就不能在这附近出现了？你们叽叽歪歪这么多，不就是想说是我们的人放的火吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸！莱蒙德，我看刚刚咱们就不该来救什么火，给他们全都烧光才好呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦急的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个时节失火之前也不是没有过，或许这就是个巧合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"可这也太巧了！哎，那边那个萨科塔小哥，你不是说这是有人放的火吗？你看这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我依然认为这是一场人为导致的火灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也和这些人一样，觉得是我干的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我并不这么认为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谎言没有任何用处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在使用助燃物的前提下，从点火到火势扩散所需的时间非常短，可以推断纵火者当时并没有离开圣堂附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，莱蒙德他......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要误解。我的意思是，在起火时有可能出现在现场的人都无法洗脱嫌疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括最先出现的各位，以及我本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你在说什么啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得我们都有可能放火？我们......像我这样的萨科塔，会亲手烧掉我们的圣堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"种族如何并不能成为脱罪的证据。如果有摧毁圣堂的必要，我不会有所犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于针对这位萨卡兹的指控，我没有在现场发现相关证据。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费尔南","speakerId":"avg_npc_933_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你这家伙倒是说得有点道理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科先生说得没错......我们不能没有证据就怀疑他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"难道就这么算了？！那可是圣堂！还有那些花，那都是你的心血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要再说了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不怀疑我们之中的任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊慌的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"争论到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔未必不会摧毁自己的圣堂。我会继续负责调查事件始末，直到找出真正的犯人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g3_abandonsancturay_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，长翅膀的，刚刚的事，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚的话题本身就是你挑起来的，要不是你说什么助燃物什么纵火的，大家也不会想歪了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，你根本就还没完全相信我吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙就不能多给点反应吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，算了。总之，我的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别指望我谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个哥哥不会说谢谢呢，萨拉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好可怜......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好可怜！不过我们可以教这个哥哥呀，谢谢不难学的！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯，但是这个哥哥有点可怕......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......胡说！谁不会说谢谢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂长翅膀的，这两个到底是哪来的臭崽子？！我从来没见过他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不认识他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思，我该认识他们吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好。关于这里的萨卡兹聚落还有这两个孩子，我有问题要问你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么问题？你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就由我来代替他回答吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德老大！刚刚的大火......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了。你处理得很好，莱蒙德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及......又见面了，执行者阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在附近站了很久，我认为你原本并不打算露面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瞒不过执行者阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么改变主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎不想见到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安稳的日子过得久了，人多少会变得有点畏缩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，执行者阁下，要不要亲自去我们那边走一趟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没什么可招待的，至少有个地方能坐下，你也能亲眼看看我们这些萨卡兹在这里是怎么生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你想问的问题......我会尽力给你解答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久没有这么活动过了，这种追击战一直都不是我擅长的部分呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于抓到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（古怪的叫声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，小声一些，这里是人家的居住区，不能打扰到其他人哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃......饿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你能说话，那就算是还可以沟通？如果是的话，那就好办多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪的吼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来没有那么简单呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不能让你再继续乱跑了，这太危险啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会联系伊比利亚的审判庭，他们对你的了解会更多一些吧？如果你真的还保留着思想的话，或许可以之后再和那边的教士倾诉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请留步，女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜色倏忽被一段波光切断。\n蕾缪安举起的铳被落在铳身上的沉重力量按下。\n执着那段波光的黑影无言静立，在转向自己的铳口之下缓慢地收回手中造型古怪的长剑。\n遮蔽月光的阴云散去。蕾缪安终于看清面前的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天还真是恶客接连上门的一天呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位教士先生，可以请你不要妨碍我吗？如果因为在这里浪费了时间，导致有人受到伤害，我会非常、非常生气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，女士，我不能为您让开这条路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还请您不要阻拦这个可怜的魂灵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有杂音，具体情况不能确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的人不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算少了，还有些人外出还没回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜深了，大家今天都先回去休息，养好精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，确定明天就走？还没回来的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就按我之前说的计划来，明早晨会后就出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科哥哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好困......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好困，而且好饿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科哥哥要送我们回家了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想回家......找妈妈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个孩子难道一直饿着肚子到现在......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈总是不吃东西，说不会饿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我们今天没吃东西，肚子好难受呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"进食需求是人体的基础需求之一，正当且合理。长期缺乏能量摄入，超过身体承受限度时会伴随不适乃至痛苦，这并不奇怪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔嗯嗯嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好复杂......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不吃东西会难受，这是正常的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那妈妈......妈妈没有东西吃，一直都很难受......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果叙述的情况属实，是的，你们的母亲一直承受着身体上的折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了，执行者阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是事实。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇哇——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的时候，事实未必适合说出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......妈妈现在也在难受吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法确定你们的母亲现在的状态。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"执行者在他人的注视下蹲下身，那些象征身份的袍角与绶带沾上尘土，在此时没有引起任何人的注意。\n费德里科·吉亚洛直视孩子们的双眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为拉特兰中庭公证所的执行者，我来这里的任务之一，就是调查这座修道院隐藏的所有真相，并维持这里的秩序稳定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调查居民失踪案件也在我的职责范畴之内，这是我的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大哥哥会帮我们找到妈妈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我会找到你们的母亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉&艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真没想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"执行者阁下，他们就暂时交给我如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无权代替他们做决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说得没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们，你们愿意和这边的这个哥哥一起走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我还得......算了，圣堂都烧了，先送他们也没问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是比费德里科哥哥还要凶的那个大哥哥。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯，好凶好凶的呢......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们两个......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，莱蒙德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们，这个哥哥一会带你们去吃东西，吃完了今天就先乖乖睡觉，好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我想和费德里科哥哥一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨拉！费德里科哥哥一看就很忙，我们不可以任性！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......嗯！我们和凶凶的哥哥一起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱蒙德，辛苦你再多跑一趟，先带孩子们吃点东西，然后送他们去休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送他们倒是没问题，但......他们要睡在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送他们去赫曼的屋子吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼那？那里现在没人，确实还可以。不过，万一赫曼晚上自己回来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，就那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科哥哥，明天见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望明天可以找到妈妈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天我会去接你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾伦戴尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！那，晚安，费德里科哥哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科哥哥，费德里科哥哥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够、够不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再下来一点点，再一点点......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝塔拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚、晚安......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！真受欢迎啊，执行者阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不懂现在的小鬼......这家伙到底哪点好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小鬼们别跑那么快！真是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本呢，我以为这一趟出差会是比较悠闲惬意的一次旅行，接一座修道院的同胞回到拉特兰，听上去确实不难，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，最多是有奥伦这位同事在，可能会多出一点麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，但是一点点小麻烦，我还是有自信能够解决的哦。毕竟奥伦也不是不通情理的人嘛~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以您使用铳的水准，确实足以解决大部分的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是要对付你，看来这种程度还是不太够呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过誉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有在夸你啦，这位......教士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是特地来掩护刚刚那位长相奇特的客人的吧？如果我猜得没错，教士先生应该来自伊比利亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然穿着教士的袍子，但我完全不觉得你是拉特兰教的信徒哦，气质完全不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很敏锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。你还真坦然，教士先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，我就实话实说了，一般我不太习惯说这么严厉的话呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在立刻离开，不许再向前一步，教士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片净土并非你可以涉足之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，暂时还不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里还有人需要我多留一阵子，拉特兰的女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啧，真难缠。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的剑很特别，这种剑术，我记得是伊比利亚的......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的攻击比言语要更加严厉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我仍对人们的相互理解抱有期望，不过，从您的角度出发，这算是妥当的应对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......我有些好奇，女士，您如何定义净土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都能安稳幸福地生活的地方。不是什么很特别的定义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，如果乱七八糟的客人再少一点，那就更好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，此处在您看来，是否确实称得上是净土？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教士先生还有心思闲聊，看来我是被小瞧了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反过来说，一群远离尘世独自生活了六十年的人，打造出一个与世隔绝的安歇之地。如果这不算是净土，什么地方才称得上是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算生活只是看不到尽头的忍饥挨冻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管物质上确实有所欠缺......但绝不是看不到尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是的。拉特兰已伸出援手，这样的苦日子很快就将结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以......抛弃一部分人为代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是任何人的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请不要误会，我无意指责任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我常常思考，人和人究竟有什么不同？阻隔我们的究竟是体魄上的差异，还是别的什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从个体诞生起，所有塑造我们的东西都驱使我们的思想走向不同方向，得出不同结论......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么在这其中，是否真的存在所谓的互相理解？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的要问一个萨科塔这个问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果下辈子有机会成为萨科塔，你可以自己试试看~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，拖得太久了，万一逃走的那家伙袭击居民就糟了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（必须得快点解决......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用这么紧张，女士，实际上，我没有打算做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我的同胞需要帮助，我才会在此。"},{"type":"narration","text":"很诚恳。但我却不能就这样信任你呢，\n咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您与我曾经的某位学生一样难以说服，这是好的品质，有时却也令人为难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能让教士先生为难的学生，倒是确实让人有些好奇呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我教导过的最出色的学生之一。可惜在他离开伊比利亚之后，我们再未相见过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来不想这样的......唉，这下又要挨骂啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交涉......失败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，我并不感到很遗憾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾缪安说话的声音很轻。动作也很轻。\n身下的代步工具被主人推开，原本被挂在扶手上的提灯在夜风中摇晃，发出“吱呀”的声响，旋即摔落在地。\n光源碎裂，不规则的光向外流淌，溅射在前方那个缓缓站起的背影上。\n沉重的夜幕在这一刻被点亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来您可以站立？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......其实还不可以哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，只是之后复健的时间又要延长，还会被唠叨而已，没问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您不会太勉强自己，女士。"},{"type":"narration","text":"您的身体状况并不乐观，这样的战斗也并非您擅长的——\n唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢夸奖。好遗憾，刚刚那一发瞄准的可是你的嘴呢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太爱说教的教士不讨人喜欢哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事情不大顺利，我正憋了一肚子火呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都被主动挑衅了，我做得稍微过头一点，应该也没有关系，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"粉发的枢机辅佐官弯起双眼，难掩的锋芒在铳上膛的声音中，终于刺穿因长年卧床而披在身上的温和外衣。\n蕾缪安发出一声不含温度的轻笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样很费力气呢，真希望我们可以速战速决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我再说一遍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——从那里让开，教士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不得踏入此处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饿......好饿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"单薄的门板被从外侧推开，它不甘的警报在夜幕中拖长了调子。\n孩子们仍在酣睡。\n尽管冷风已从敞开的缝隙中灌入这个破旧的、小小的家，未知的威胁已无声地侵入，缓慢地靠近......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饿......吃、吃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
